     &lt;/head&gt;
     &lt;body&gt;
    &lt;p class="p1"&gt;Security Update 2020-004 is recommended for all users and improves the security of macOS.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;
    &lt;p class="p1"&gt;For more information on the security content of this update see &lt;a href="https://support.apple.com/kb/HT201222"&gt;https://support.apple.com/kb/HT201222&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/body&gt;
 &lt;/html&gt;

';
</strings>
